            "notes": "Note: This build excels playing into and with brawlier compositions, playing this into a team running full poke is hellish and I do NOT recommend it.\n\nWe start Round 1 by taking [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), this power is a great addition to our build as we will be focusing primarily on repair packs, the reason we don't take [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8) first is because Packstacker offers us more money generation in the early game, making the required items in Round 3 easier to get!\n\nFrom Round 1 to 3 we will be focusing on stacking as much [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) as possible, this is important as not only does it make our repair packs more potent, but affords us a good source of damage via our whipshot and makes our inspire all the more powerful, this build will become a frontlining demon once we get to Round 3.",
