        {
            "id": "07bb769c-d6b1-4e88-9409-9ac4be36a3ad",
            "build_id": "7623db0b-a57b-48f8-bf89-16b571762995",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-28T21:22:56.643847+00:00",
            "notes": "[Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) is the power we will be taking, this enables us to get rally probably midway through first fight, but will also give us even more cooldown reduction for our repair packs, more packs = more tankiness for us.\n\nOur item pickup this round will be [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) as it provides us a lot of additional sustain via life steal and overhealth, and provides some additional stats to make us even stronger.\n\n[IF YOU WANT TO FOCUS ON RALLY] An alternative to [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) if you want to utilize rally more often is [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4), you will already get rally quite fast without this but it'll supercharge your ult generation allowing you to spam rally every fight.\n\nAside from that focus on getting as much [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed) to fill up any empty slots you may have, [Weapon Lifesteal](stat_weapon_lifesteal) is also a good pickup as well if you want to further enable [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643)",
